      "Buy Dad With 1 Yuan",
      "",
      "When I was small, my dad opened a restaurant. At that time, my dad was very busy.",
      "He went to work at 5 o’clock in the morning, and returned home at 10 o’clock at night.",
      "He also worked on Saturday and Sunday, and very seldom played with me.",
      "",
      "I asked mom, “Mom, I miss dad. Does dad miss me?”",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Why don’t you ask dad?”",
      "",
      "I asked dad, “Dad, when you aren’t at home, do you miss me?”",
      "",
      "Dad said, “Dad misses you very much.”",
      "",
      "I asked again, “Dad, from running a restaurant, how much money do you make in one day?”",
      "",
      "Dad laughed and said, “1 yuan.”",
      "",
      "I said, “Dad, I will give you 1 yuan. Tomorrow is Sunday. Can you stay at home and play with me?”",
      "",
      "From that day onwards, dad no longer went to work on Sunday.",
